OL,3,GNEWSA'I won't step down' says Parades
OL,4,ACommission chair after Drumcree parade
OL,5,Aruling
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe chair of the Parades Commission has
OL,8,Fsaid she and her colleagues do not
OL,9,Fintend to resign.
OL,11,FProfessor Evelyn Collins was speaking
OL,12,Ftwo days after a court case highlighted
OL,13,Fmistakes made by the commission in its
OL,14,Fruling on last month's planned parade
OL,15,Fby the Orange Order to Drumcree church
OL,16,Fin Portadown.
OL,18,FUnionist parties and the Orange Order
OL,19,Fhave called for the commission to stand
OL,20,Fdown, but Prof Collins said they intend
OL,21,Fto stay in post.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
